      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Missouri_Rhineland",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1980, Augusta, Missouri, became the first American Viticultural Area, and Hermann followed in 1983.",
